flickos-fleet (1.0~test1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * First version (docs/design/flickos-fleet.md phase 2, step 2): check
    FILE [--dry-run] applies a policy file: site defaults checked by
    their owners, system settings through flickos-control, countme, and
    apply-defaults in each desktop session.
  * join, run, status and leave (step 3): the service's requests (ADR-
    010), the token in /etc/flickos/fleet (root only), the daily
    inventory, packages.install and packages.remove, flickos-fleet.timer
    (enabled by join, not by the package), PRIVACY.md.
  * lookup CODE (no root): the organization a join code is for, which
    Settings shows before asking for the password; polkit actions for
    join and leave.

